<mj-body>
<mj-wrapper css-class="card">
<mj-section>
<mj-column>
<mj-image src="https://homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/home-insulation-victoria-logo.png" alt="Home Insulation Victoria" width="132px" align="left" padding="0 12px 2px" />
</mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section>
<mj-column>
<mj-text mj-class="hi">Hi James,</mj-text>
<mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading" padding="4px 12px 10px">Ready Check done. Time to price it.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Here's what John found at Sarah's place. Enter your price and Home Insulation Victoria sends them the quote once every check passes.</mj-text>
</mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section>
<mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
<mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 2px">HV-1234 · Sarah Brown</mj-text>
<mj-text mj-class="small" padding="0 18px 12px">12 Example St, Box Hill VIC 3128 · Ready Check Tue 4 Nov</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 12px">Measured ceiling: 120 m² (2 areas)</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 12px">Existing insulation: Thin batts, R1.0</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 12px">Removal needed: None</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 12px">Roof: Sloped, tiles</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 12px">Access: Standard</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 12px">Product chosen: Bradford Gold R5.0</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 12px">Downlights: 4</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 18px">Built in last 5 years: No · Life support: No</mj-text>
</mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section>
<mj-column>
<mj-text padding="8px 0 0">
</mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/field/TEST-JOB#price">Enter your price</mj-button>
<mj-text mj-class="small">Your price stays editable until the quote is sent.</mj-text>
<mj-text mj-class="small">
<a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/api/files/TEST/Ready-Check.pdf" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">See the full Ready Check ›</a>
</mj-text>
</mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section>
<mj-column>
<mj-divider padding="14px 12px 14px" />
